graph TD
    subgraph Data_Preparation [Data Preparation]
        A[STRAMPN Dataset] --> B[Inventory & Integrity Check]
        B --> C[Stratified Split 75/25]
        C --> D[Training/Validation Pool]
        C --> E[Held-out Test Set]
        D --> F[Final Split 70/30]
    end

    subgraph Experimentation [72-Run Experiment Matrix]
        F --> G[Data Generators]
        G --> H{4 Architectures}
        H --> I{6 Optimizers}
        I --> J{3 Learning Rates}
        
        J --> K[Training with Callbacks]
        K --> L[EarlyStopping / Checkpointing]
    end

    subgraph Evaluation [Analysis & Results]
        L --> M[Test Set Evaluation]
        E --> M
        M --> N[Metric Aggregation]
        N --> O[Heatmaps & Comparative Analysis]
    end

    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style E fill:#f96,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style O fill:#6f6,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
